== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|nr}}Poop spawned by Larry Jr. will never drop pickups, even when in possession of {{t|Petrified Poop}}.
** {{Dlc|r}}Poops spawned by Larry Jr. have an incredibly low chance to spawn pickups. This chance is not affected by Petrified Poop.
** Leaving the room and returning will make the poop generate pickups normally.
* {{dlc|nr}} The {{i|D12|n}} doesn't reroll Larry Jr.'s poop.
* Destroying Larry Jr.'s poop with {{t|Brown Cap}} will cause it to explode.
* [[Piercing tears]] make fighting Larry Jr. much easier, as each tear can damage multiple segments.

== Trivia ==
* Larry Jr. appeared in the original ''The Binding of Isaac.''
* {{e|The Hollow}} is the posthumous version of him.
* Larry Jr. is an allusion to ''[[supermeatboy:Larries Lament|Larries' Lament]]'', the name for a group of bosses in Edmund McMillen's game, ''Super Meat Boy''.
** Not only do they look similar but ''smaller Larries'' came from a dead Larry in the Super Meat Boy credits. This is a strong indication that those smaller Larries and Larry Jr. are the same.
* In battle, Larry Jr. seems to be crying and has blood on the lower belly of his body, unlike the splash screen before the fight.
* Larry Jr. might be a reference to the centipede enemies from the 1980 arcade game [[wikipedia:Centipede (video game)|Centipede]].

